# Not a secret. This is a static site, so whatever is here ends up readable in
# the shipped JavaScript anyway — a Realtime Database URL is public by design.
# What actually protects the data is the database rules, not this file.
# In a project with real secrets (server keys, tokens) this file would be
# gitignored and the value would come from a CI secret instead.
VITE_FIREBASE_URL=https://home-cleaning-schedule-ca19b-default-rtdb.asia-southeast1.firebasedatabase.app
